<title>USA: General Magnaplate sets $0.07 payout.</title>
<headline>General Magnaplate sets $0.07 payout.</headline>
<dateline>LINDEN, N.J. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Magnaplate Corp said Wednesday it will pay a dividend of $0.07 per share on October 15 to holders of record September 27.</p>
<p>On March 8 the company made a $0.05 payment.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
